          ["W_LOAD_GND","forward"],
          ["W_BAT_GND","reverse"]
        ],
        "control":[["W_SWITCH_COIL","forward"]]
      },
      "note":"Command on: the protected control branch energizes the relay coil. The normally open relay contact is represented closed, allowing the separately protected load branch to supply the electrical load."
    }
